#: ../../source/classes/class_modifyandroidbuildtemplateplugin.rst:16 89ce1c6c32944626b2fabfea59f13b84
msgid "Editor plugin for installing FMOD Android libraries into the Android build template."
msgstr "将 FMOD Android 库安装到 Android 构建模板中的编辑器插件。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_modifyandroidbuildtemplateplugin.rst:21 9595addc07b74e23aa878e0917c6c5d8
msgid "Description"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../../source/classes/class_modifyandroidbuildtemplateplugin.rst:21
#: 2291db85ba6a47c59b54a089a3a5a397
msgid ""
"Adds ``Configure FMOD Android Export`` to the editor Tools menu. Accepts an extracted FMOD "
"Core Android SDK folder or a ``.tar.gz``/``.tgz`` archive and presents the proposed changes "
"for review."
msgstr ""
"在编辑器的工具菜单中添加  ``Configure FMOD Android Export`` \\ 。可选择解压后的 FMOD Core Android SDK 目录或  "
"``.tar.gz`` / ``.tgz``  压缩包，并在执行前预览更改。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_modifyandroidbuildtemplateplugin.rst:23
#: 8fe4859e087b44d6aba64ebf103cce55
msgid ""
"Configures the installed Android build template: copies ``fmod.jar`` and available ABI "
"runtime libraries into debug, dev, and release directories; copies available arm64 extension "
"libraries; updates Gradle dependencies and Java runtime initialization."
msgstr ""
"配置已安装的 Android 构建模板：复制  ``fmod.jar`` \\ ，将可用架构的运行库复制到 debug、dev 和 release 目录，复制可用的 arm64 "
"扩展库，并更新 Gradle 依赖和 Java 运行时初始化代码。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_modifyandroidbuildtemplateplugin.rst:25
#: ee876a7bb6c94041ae72db1c98cf68dc
msgid "This class is only available in the editor."
msgstr "此类仅在编辑器中可用。"
